.TH ARCH "1" "2026-07-28" "BNU 9.11" "BNU Commands"
.SH NAME
arch \- print machine hardware name (same as uname -m)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B arch
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.\" This page is derived from GNU Coreutils documentation.
This page documents BNU, an independent Bun implementation compatible with
GNU Coreutils 9.11.
.PP
Print machine architecture.
.TP
\X'tty: link https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/arch#arch--help'\fB\-\-help\fP\X'tty: link'
display this help and exit
.TP
\X'tty: link https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/arch#arch--version'\fB\-\-version\fP\X'tty: link'
output version information and exit
